{
  "info": {
    "name": "Google Health API - Fitbit migration probes (full)",
    "description": "Every data type the Google_Health_Fetch.py addon queries, grouped by record kind.\n\nSETUP:\n1. Collection > Variables: fill client_id, client_secret, refresh_token (from google_health.token).\n2. Run '0. Refresh Access Token' first (saves access_token automatically; logs granted scopes).\n3. Run any request. All inherit Bearer {{access_token}}.\n\nDATE WINDOW: start_iso/end_iso for timestamp types (sample/interval/session), start_date/end_date for daily types. Keep heart-rate windows <= 14 days; others <= 90 days.\n\nFILTER FIELD BY KIND: sample -> <type>.sample_time.physical_time | interval -> <type>.interval.start_time | session -> <type>.interval.end_time | daily -> <type>.date  (type is snake_case in the filter, kebab-case in the URL path).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://health.googleapis.com/v4/users/me"
    },
    {
      "key": "token_url",
      "value": "https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_id",
      "value": "PASTE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_secret",
      "value": "PASTE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET"
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh_token",
      "value": "PASTE_GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "start_iso",
      "value": "2026-08-01T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "key": "end_iso",
      "value": "2026-08-07T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "key": "start_date",
      "value": "2026-08-01"
    },
    {
      "key": "end_date",
      "value": "2026-08-07"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Refresh Access Token  (run first)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "var j = pm.response.json();",
              "if (j.access_token) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.access_token);",
              "  console.log('access_token saved. scopes:', j.scope);",
              "} else { console.log('No access_token:', pm.response.text()); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "grant_type",
              "value": "refresh_token"
            },
            {
              "key": "refresh_token",
              "value": "{{refresh_token}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_id",
              "value": "{{client_id}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_secret",
              "value": "{{client_secret}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{token_url}}",
          "host": [
            "{{token_url}}"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sample types",
      "description": "Point-in-time measurements. Filter on <type>.sample_time.physical_time.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Heart Rate (intraday, <=14d window)  [heart-rate]",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/dataTypes/heart-rate/dataPoints?filter=heart_rate.sample_time.physical_time >= \"{{start_iso}}\" AND heart_rate.sample_time.physical_time < \"{{end_iso}}\"&pageSize=100",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "dataTypes",
                "heart-rate",
                "dataPoints"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "filter",
                  "value": "heart_rate.sample_time.physical_time >= \"{{start_iso}}\" AND heart_rate.sample_time.physical_time < \"{{end_iso}}\""
                },
                {
                  "key": "pageSize",
                  "value": "100"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
