    {
      "name": "Reconcile (merged, deduped across sources)",
      "description": "The :reconcile method returns Google's single merged stream (no per-source duplicates). Use for multi-device metrics like steps/distance/heart-rate to avoid double-counting. If :reconcile rejects the filter query param (like :dailyRollUp did), we'll switch to its documented request shape.",
